rule = "Dice given to this tile return to your hand. A [color=yellow]1[/color], [color=yellow]2[/color] or [color=yellow]3[/color] unlocks it instead and goes to a [color=purple]random enemy[/color]. Lasts until unlocked or you jump. The Engine Charger can't be locked."
